# Planted defects in senior-pm-inconsistent.json. Every field here is
# individually well-typed — what breaks is the set of cross-field invariants
# `agents/prd-senior-pm.md` Step 7 states in prose. A decision sheet whose
# counts describe a different run than its own arrays cannot be presented at
# Gate 3: the user would be approving numbers that do not match the tickets.

